## ðŸ”¹ Playwright with C# in CI/CD

### Build & Test

``` yaml
- name: Setup .NET
  uses: actions/setup-dotnet@v3
  with:
    dotnet-version: '8.0.x'

- name: Restore dependencies
  run: dotnet restore

- name: Build
  run: dotnet build --no-restore --configuration Release

- name: Test
  run: xvfb-run -a dotnet test --no-build --configuration Release --logger "trx;LogFileName=test-results.trx"
```

### Handling Playwright Browsers

``` yaml
- name: Install Playwright Browsers
  run: pwsh bin/Debug/net8.0/playwright.ps1 install
```

### Artifacts (Logs, Screenshots, Reports)

``` yaml
- name: Upload test results
  uses: actions/upload-artifact@v3
  with:
    name: test-logs
    path: |
      TestResults/
      Logs/
      Screenshots/
      Resources/
```

-   **Artifacts** let you collect outputs (logs, screenshots, reports)
    from the pipeline.\
-   You can also use **actions/download-artifact@v3** to get artifacts
    in later jobs.

