## ðŸ”¹ Git Basics

### Config

Check configs:

``` bash
git config --list
git config --global --list
```

Set configs:

``` bash
git config --global user.name "Your Name"
git config --global user.email "your@email.com"
```

### Branches

-   Create branch:

    ``` bash
    git checkout -b feature/new-feature
    ```

-   Switch branch:

    ``` bash
    git checkout develop
    ```

-   Push branch:

    ``` bash
    git push origin feature/new-feature
    ```

### Comparing Branches

``` bash
git diff develop..HEAD         # Show code differences
git log develop..HEAD --oneline  # Show commit differences
```

### Merge vs Rebase

-   **Merge** â†’ Keeps history with extra merge commits.\
-   **Rebase** â†’ Rewrites history, cleaner but riskier.

