## ðŸ”¹ Commit Safety & Confirmation

-   Use **hooks** for confirmation:\
    `.git/hooks/pre-push`

    ``` bash
    #!/bin/sh
    read -p "Are you sure you want to push? (y/n) " ans
    if [ "$ans" != "y" ]; then
      echo "Push canceled."
      exit 1
    fi
    ```

-   Or use **aliases** for safe commit/push with prompts.

