## ðŸ”¹ Working with Mistakes

### Case: Made changes in `develop` but want them in a new branch

-   If **uncommitted**:

    ``` bash
    git checkout -b feature/fix-scripts
    git add .
    git commit -m "Fix scripts"
    ```

-   If **committed**:

    ``` bash
    git checkout -b feature/fix-scripts
    git checkout develop
    git reset --hard HEAD~1
    ```

